("Assessment starts with a shared understanding of purpose and role.", "At first contact with Tunde, what should the worker establish?", "The purpose, role, information use and Tunde's priorities in accessible language.", ["A complete life history before explaining the service.","An outcome chosen by the worker alone.","A promise that every requested service will be provided."], "Engagement gives context for informed participation and realistic expectations."),
