("Referral information is relevant, authorised and securely shared.", "What should be included in a referral for training access?", "The relevant agreed information, purpose and accessibility needs through an authorised route.", ["The entire case file regardless of relevance.","Unverified allegations unrelated to training.","Personal details posted in a public group."], "The referral should serve its specific purpose and protect information."),
